{
  "title": "My Trash Skill 'Appraisal' Awakened into 'Inheritance' — Now I Wield the Power of Heroes and Stand Unmatched!",
  "description": "My Trash Skill 'Appraisal' Awakened into 'Inheritance' — Now I Wield the Power of Heroes and Stand Unmatched!\n\nSummary:\nLacking any combat skills, Eustus was just another adventurer stuck at the bottom. \n\nThat is, until the day his life changed forever when he awakened \"Inheritance\", the power to gain the memories and abilities of anyone, simply by touching something they once owned! \n\nHe starts by tapping into the legacies of the heroes who once saved the world: the unmatched Sword Saint, the far-seeing Archer, the god-speed Lancer, the miracle-working Saintess, and the prodigy Archmage… inheriting their very lives and skills!\n\nWith the strength and spirit of legends flowing through him, Eustus' journey from zero to the strongest in history begins!",
  "artist": "Miyake Riku",
  "author": "Hinokage Sora",
  "cover": "https://mangadex.org/covers/bfefd314-f0c3-49d8-9d64-67a7011e5c30/93fd4d8b-cd91-4972-ac60-7177ec07ca93.jpg",
